# Falcon PMS Config System — Implementation Status & Operations Guide

**Document purpose:** This replaces the earlier presentation Q&A draft. It records what the Config app is designed to do, what is **implemented in code today**, what is **partially** available, and what remains **planned** for a later phase. It also documents capabilities added during stabilization work (Phases A–D) that were not in the original training outline.

**Last updated:** May 2026  
**Codebase areas:** `apps/configs/` (backend), `frontend/src/pages/config`, `frontend/src/components/config`, `Docs/config/`

