## Executive summary

The Config app is the operational control plane for Falcon PMS: backups, maintenance, disaster recovery, health monitoring, scheduling, quotas, encryption, audit, and platform settings. The **backend engine is largely complete**; the **admin UI covers most operational flows**. Recent work standardized app registration (CIA-aligned), added real-time progress over WebSockets, persisted system settings, and an App Registry console.

