## CIA triad — how the implementation supports it

| Pillar | Implementation |
|--------|----------------|
| **Confidentiality** | Config routes restricted to Super Admin / Client Admin; registry and system settings **writes** Super Admin only; encryption at rest for backups; audit log of sensitive actions; no secrets in registry metadata |
| **Integrity** | Canonical app definitions + sync; immutable app `name` on PATCH; RTO ≥ RPO validation; versioned settings; backup checksum verification; dependency cycle detection |
| **Availability** | `is_critical`, `recovery_priority`, recovery sequence; health endpoints; maintenance mode; DR failover/failback; real-time ops visibility |

